{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Two thousand eight was a credit crush...most purchases are cash, but it's very hard for a cash market to have a heart attack.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000002"}], "text": "The market in 2008 was largely affected by a credit crisis, while the current market in 2026 operates mostly on cash purchases, making it less susceptible to sudden crashes."}, "title": "Market Differences between 2008 and 2026", "topic": "economic_comparison"}, "content_hash": "e39369dafcf2a034330191231e63070758d14a626d2b3b7d8c8959ac75335976", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:knowledge:bfe5fc24e9a91032", "metadata_hash": "5c10117281ca661f2dcd6a7dd0e0d5e7c6ddc978ca85b50d25b79a733fa64f67", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T15:30:13Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "56d28e9d3fca6fa47f5fce41022b484be0ee36643b2cbea5e6f905ec279fd5fd", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdtyW7zhRKb/", "title": "Market Differences between 2008 and 2026", "topic": "economic_comparison", "topic_slug": "economic_comparison"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000003", "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000004", "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "What creates the real demand for this specific property? Not to buy, not to brochure.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"}], "text": "Consider what creates real demand for the property."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "how many new identical units gonna be handed over within the year in the same district?", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"}], "text": "Assess how many new identical units will be handed over in the next year in the same district."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "who buys it or rents it from you and why yours instead the one on the floor above?", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"}], "text": "Determine who buys or rents the property and why they would choose it over others."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Before you sign anything, answer free questions.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000003"}], "text": "Before signing any real estate deals, consider the real demand for the property, how many similar units will be available, and who will rent or buy it from you."}, "title": "Real Estate Investment Questions", "topic": "investment_advice"}, "content_hash": "e39369dafcf2a034330191231e63070758d14a626d2b3b7d8c8959ac75335976", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:knowledge:0952cbf1807cc97a", "metadata_hash": "5c10117281ca661f2dcd6a7dd0e0d5e7c6ddc978ca85b50d25b79a733fa64f67", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T15:30:13Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "56d28e9d3fca6fa47f5fce41022b484be0ee36643b2cbea5e6f905ec279fd5fd", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdtyW7zhRKb/", "title": "Real Estate Investment Questions", "topic": "investment_advice", "topic_slug": "investment_advice"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "In two thousand eight, a shock on the other side of the world broke this market in half...Today, most purchases are cash, but it's very hard for a cash market to have a heart attack.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000002"}], "text": "The speaker compares the 2008 market crisis to the 2026 market conditions, highlighting the differences in finance sources and market stability."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Comparison of Market Conditions", "topic": "economic_comparison"}, "content_hash": "e39369dafcf2a034330191231e63070758d14a626d2b3b7d8c8959ac75335976", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:expression:12e3c6f1073e10ea", "metadata_hash": "5c10117281ca661f2dcd6a7dd0e0d5e7c6ddc978ca85b50d25b79a733fa64f67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-25T15:30:13Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "56d28e9d3fca6fa47f5fce41022b484be0ee36643b2cbea5e6f905ec279fd5fd", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdtyW7zhRKb/", "title": "Comparison of Market Conditions", "topic": "economic_comparison", "topic_slug": "economic_comparison"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "What creates the real demand for this specific property?...who buys it or rents it from you and why yours instead the one on the floor above?", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:u000005"}], "text": "The speaker provides a structured series of questions to consider before making a real estate investment: demand, competition, and buyer reasoning."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Investment Advice Framework", "topic": "investment_advice"}, "content_hash": "e39369dafcf2a034330191231e63070758d14a626d2b3b7d8c8959ac75335976", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91:expression:cc1dcd9946c92ca2", "metadata_hash": "5c10117281ca661f2dcd6a7dd0e0d5e7c6ddc978ca85b50d25b79a733fa64f67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-25T15:30:13Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "56d28e9d3fca6fa47f5fce41022b484be0ee36643b2cbea5e6f905ec279fd5fd", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-25-what-to-expect-in-2026-md-f18f23bd91", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdtyW7zhRKb/", "title": "Investment Advice Framework", "topic": "investment_advice", "topic_slug": "investment_advice"}
